/key-management.mdx","Claves y motores criptográficos","Genera, importa y opera claves sin acoplar la PKI a un proveedor concreto.",{"_61":128},"platform/pki/key-management.mdx",{"_38":130,"_45":56,"_40":131,"_50":132,"_58":-7,"_12":133,"_59":134},"es:platform/pki/certificate-authorities.mdx","Autoridades","Crea, importa y opera las autoridades que establecen la confianza de tu PKI.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities",{"_61":135},"platform/pki/certificate-authorities.mdx",{"_38":137,"_45":56,"_40":138,"_50":139,"_58":-7,"_12":140,"_59":141},"es:platform/pki/certificate-profiles.mdx","Perfiles de certificado","Define políticas reutilizables para emitir certificados coherentes y limitar las claves aceptadas.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles",{"_61":142},"platform/pki/certificate-profiles.mdx",{"_38":144,"_45":56,"_40":145,"_50":146,"_58":-7,"_12":147,"_59":148},"es:platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation.mdx","Jerarquía y rotación","Diseña autoridades raíz e intermedias y sustituye certificados o claves sin romper la confianza.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation",{"_61":149},"platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation.mdx",{"_38":151,"_45":56,"_40":152,"_50":153,"_58":-7,"_12":154,"_59":155},"es:platform/pki/certificates.mdx","Certificados","Consulta, descarga y revoca los certificados emitidos por Lamassu.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/pki/certificates",{"_61":156},"platform/pki/certificates.mdx",{"_38":158,"_45":81,"_58":-7,"_40":159},"es:_3","Validación",{"_38":161,"_45":56,"_40":162,"_50":163,"_58":-7,"_12":164,"_59":165},"es:platform/pki/certificate-validation.mdx","Validación de certificados","Comprueba cadena, identidad, usos y revocación desde el consumidor.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation",{"_61":166},"platform/pki/certificate-validation.mdx",{"_38":168,"_45":56,"_40":169,"_50":170,"_58":-7,"_12":171,"_59":172},"es:platform/pki/ocsp.mdx